WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:03.420
They say nothing good happens after midnight.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.245
Clearly… they've never been to Night Arcade.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.820
Thirteen original games.

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.320
Race the city. Swallow it whole.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.056
Build an army. Ride the storm.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.470
And every single one comes in two worlds.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.170
The Original… or full 3D.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:30.170
One tap. Same game. Whole new night.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.873
Your phone. Your laptop. Your controller.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.995
Bring your own soundtrack.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:40.406
No downloads. No sign-ups. Totally free.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.373
Night Arcade. Play the night.
